      "description": "Audit individual proofs and the network of proofs for gaps. Detects intra-proof gaps (unproved assertions, existence without proof, uniqueness asserted but not shown, hand-waving, missing citations) and inter-proof gaps (missing bridging lemmas, broken chains of implication, unstated propositions needed to tie results together).",
